msgid ""
"Limits the number of cells that get retrieved. Not applied when non-"
"additive metrics (e.g. ratios, COUNT_DISTINCT, AVG, percentiles) are "
"present, since totals and subtotals are then computed via a database "
"rollup query that must see every row to stay correct."
